          "text": "Sleep pattern"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Over approximately 3–4 weeks, sleep has worsened. Difficulty initiating and maintaining sleep; goes to bed at 23:00–00:00 and is often awake until 02:00–03:00, wakes 3–4 times, and estimates 3–4 hours of broken sleep nightly. Sleep is non-restorative."
